   "description": "The district Dreta, which is managed by RD Mozirje starts at the Dreta's spring under the Črnivec and ends at the confluence with the Savinja in the village Nazarje. The district is 22 km long. The average depth of the Dreta is between 0,5 and 1,0 m except in pools and below dams. The bottom is marl or covered with gravel limestone."
