   "subtitle": "",
   "description": "The pond Gaj is in Mozirje, in the near vicinity of Mozirski gaj. Its surface measures 1 ha. It has a very well managed course at the half of the pond with access to the wheelchairs. so fishermen with disabilities can fish here, too. The pond's shore is decorated with benches that enable relaxed fishing. The pond is 3 m deep, the water temperature varies from 5 to 20 C."
