   "subtitle": "from Grušovlje to Letuš",
   "description": "The district Savinja, which is managed by RD Mozirje starts at Grušovlje dam in the village Grušovlje and ends at the bridge across the Savinja in the village Letuš. The average depth of the Savinja in this district is between 0,5 and 1,5 m, except in pools and below dams. The bottom is marl or covered with gravel limestone.The current changes in this district; the rapid parts are followed by still waters."
